評分獲4分的抽濕機：美的Midea MDDF-20PB\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8ca7ef78d2c100812fe2e9b867acd65a/2023-02/wet_30.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"總評分獲4分的抽濕機：美的Midea MDDF-20PB\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/58ec7063c91cfae5a0a504bb0b51a7bd/2023-02/wet_31_0.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"總評分獲4分的抽濕機：美的Midea MDDF-20PB\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f3f19040be5b4853b30ae49bcd34b909/2023-02/wet_32_0.png\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T08:21:03.893364+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":903,"images":34,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T08:00:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T09:58:58.495703+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T08:18:21.702451+00:00","content_hash":"9c0c1a723a46445cb5576f970fc6bd54cc7a52244fc3e5ccf042b6a6862983fe","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}